69
00:12:30.215 --> 00:12:32.013
Getting some.

70
00:12:32.612 --> 00:12:34.773
Once it reaches the higher ups,
my share won't be much.

71
00:12:35.010 --> 00:12:36.808
Are you crazy?

72
00:12:37.408 --> 00:12:39.206
